Spec: Windows control transport verification

Purpose:
  Verify native pipe negotiation and failure isolation without installed services or cloud access.

Owns:
  ./LinkGate.Broker.Tests.csproj
  ./Program.cs

References:
  ../LinkGate.Broker/LinkGate.Broker.sdd
  ./ConnectionPlannerTests.sdd

Must:
  Offer a focused secure-stream regression for relay heartbeat fixes without repeating unrelated platform suites.
  Offer a focused scoped-routing suite containing only affected permission, journal, planner and control-boundary scenarios.
  Run the formal connection boundary tests with an explicit fake provider separately from real authenticated transport acceptance.
  Run retained connection journal and business meter verification alongside platform regressions.
  Run exact local visitor access verification alongside existing preview regressions.
  Use unique test pipe suffixes and cancel all owned listeners on exit.
  Distinguish executed local-user tests from unexecuted other-user and remote-machine tests.
